  "description": "A chunky low-poly zombie. Low-poly character by Quaternius (CC0 1.0, public domain), from the animated model used in the KherveOS games, here in its rest pose. 1800 mm tall (1079 x 659 x 1800 mm), standing on z = 0, centred on x/y, facing -Y. Built as one Object of 5 coloured imported meshes (STL files in meshes/zombie2/ beside this part); scale the Object to resize it. 3550 triangles.",
